{}


# ================================================================ student services (S5) — request examples with bodies
### Raise a support request (student) — owner is routed by category
POST {{base}}/api/v1/support-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"category": "Recording access", "details": "The recording for the 24 Sep class is held. When will it be released?"}

### Support requests escalated to the Branch Manager (SLA breach or manual)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/support-requests?escalated=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reply / internal remark / resolve / escalate / reassign / reopen
POST {{base}}/api/v1/support-requests/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body": "Looking into it", "internal": false}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/support-requests/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "Resolved", "note": "Recording released after review"}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/support-requests/1/escalate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Needs a decision from the Branch Manager"}

### Notifications: views are my | action | unread | completed | system
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications?view=action
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"preferences": [{"group": "Learning reminders", "channel": "WhatsApp", "enabled": true}]}

### Career: opt in, consent, apply (student)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me/career/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"opted_in": true, "preferred_roles": ["Data Analyst"], "skills": ["SQL", "Python"]}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/me/career/opportunities/1/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Career: staff create, verify (a second person) and move an application
POST {{base}}/api/v1/opportunities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Junior Data Analyst", "employer_name": "Sample Analytics Pvt Ltd", "branch_id": 1}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/opportunities/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "Active", "verification_source": "Employer website and HR call"}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "Interview Scheduled", "interview_round": "Technical round 2", "interview_at": "2026-10-02T15:00:00+05:30"}

### Ask Nipuna
POST {{base}}/api/v1/ask-nipuna/queries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "When is my next class?", "action": null}
